  "student_passage": "Our class went for a bicycle ride near a (1) ____ last Sunday. We did not go into the trees because the path was too wet. Our teacher brought two (2) ____; each showed a different route back to the school. We chose the shorter route and followed the river.\n\nOne of the bicycles was too (3) ____ for Ben's long legs, so he used the teacher's spare one. His brother was two years (4) ____ than him and had a much smaller bicycle. We rode (5) ____ near the village because people were walking along the same road.\n\nAt the river we crossed a wooden (6) ____. On the other side, everyone was hungry. We ate cheese (7) ____ and drank water from our own bottles. The teacher said we should not leave any paper behind (8) ____ animals might try to eat it.\n\nThere was only one pump for all our bicycles, so we had to (9) ____ using it. Before we left, the teacher asked us to (10) ____ the name of the village. She wanted us to be able to find it on the classroom map the next morning.",
